<https://bob.example.org/2026/09/still-rss/> <http://purl.org/rss/1.0/link> "https://bob.example.org/2026/09/still-rss/" .
<https://bob.example.org/2026/09/still-rss/> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/identifier> "https://bob.example.org/?p=371" .
<https://bob.example.org/2026/09/still-rss/> <http://purl.org/rss/1.0/description> "No algorithm decides what I see. [&#8230;]" .
<https://bob.example.org/2026/09/still-rss/> <http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/encoded> "<p>No algorithm decides what I see. A feed reader is a list of names I chose.</p>" .
